(radar-relative)
*title Radar and relative observation
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*radar 1 origin alt=0 long=0 latgd=0
*trajectory 1 observer start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=10 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file observer.dat time yecfc relrng[2] relvel[2] radrng[1] radrngdt[1]
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*trajectory 2 target start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=1000 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=-10 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file target.dat time yecfc
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when time=10 stop
*file compare.dat time[1] relrng[2][1] relvel[2][1] radrng[1][1]
*end
